g","time":"2021-03-10T01:58:20+08:00","caption":"橙色的是混合果汁，有濃郁的香蕉味，飽肚感100分，非常足料。綠色的是薄荷檸檬汁，口味清新。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0TjRI00"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1G/15NA/0885MD997F2A4470F1159Cpx.jpg","time":"2021-03-10T01:58:20+08:00","caption":"價錢最貴算是這雜錦燒烤了，份量十足，最後吃不完要外帶回家😂。有多種烤肉，還有薑黃飯，外表很重口味，但吃下去沒有很咸，牛肉很惹味。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0TTRI00"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1G/15NA/0885MCB563581A1A9AB43Apx.jpg","time":"2021-03-10T01:58:20+08:00","caption":"好像是無酵包？包本身沒有什麼味道，硬硬的。跟三角豆醬和混合沙拉一起吃很不錯。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0TDRI00"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1G/15NA/0885MB93F6180208B80B4Fpx.jpg","time":"2021-03-10T01:58:20+08:00","caption":"豆泥沒有什麼味道，就豆的味道。混合沙拉的味道相當不錯，淡口味的人，可以跟豆泥和阿拉伯包一起吃。我下次會全份點混合沙拉，5星是給混合沙拉的 😂😂😂","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Syjf00"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1G/15NA/0885MA47EED2F5A5C8D665px.jpg","time":"2021-03-10T01:58:20+08:00","caption":"烤魚上面的香料很惹味，魚烤得剛好，肉很鮮。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0SjRI00"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto2/photo/1G/15NA/0885M95E3CB16114DAC939px.jpg","time":"2021-03-10T01:58:20+08:00","caption":"跟賣相一樣很清新的沙律","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0STRI00"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto/photo/G/DCY/02N07G894AEBD21D0C6DAEpx.jpg","time":"2016-11-19T20:57:17+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0pA9300"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto/photo/9/7F1/01GR1C246310EF228C487Dpx.jpg","time":"2015-05-12T22:23:50+08:00","caption":"炸鷹嘴豆餅。很傳統的埃及菜式。既香脆,味道因內含的香料變得有層次。 午市埋單每人約$150。服務員很有禮貌。地方一般但食物不錯。不妨一試。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0u8qb00"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto/photo/9/7F1/01GR1A4CFCFE79EB334F82px.jpg","time":"2015-05-12T22:23:50+08:00","caption":"薯條亦炸得不錯。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0teqb00"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto/photo/9/7F1/01GR19B3C771A181BBE05Cpx.jpg","t